OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few early showers in the far
OL,6,Fnorth, otherwise a chilly start with
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Cloud increases from the
OL,8,Fwest with rain reaching the Isles
OL,9,Faround midday extending slowly east
OL,10,Facross Highland during the afternoon.
OL,11,FStrengthening southerly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with the rain becoming
OL,14,Fheavier at times this evening and into
OL,15,Fthe night especially in the west. The
OL,16,FIsles turning clearer later with
OL,17,Fscattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,176,160,301,260,100,100
