OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAny lingering rain in
OL,6,Fnortheast soon clearing then a day of
OL,7,Fsunny intervals and blustery showers
OL,8,Fthese heavier and more frequent in the
OL,9,Fwest. Windy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSaturday will be another day of
OL,13,Ffrequent showers, heavy at times, and
OL,14,Fsome sunny intervals. Mainly dry and
OL,15,Fbright on Sunday, light showers in
OL,16,Fnorth. Monday cloudier, patchy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
